  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 202.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 202.01 Purpose. The solid waste rules are intended to apply to a variety of conditions and uses. It is recognized that strict compliance with all solid waste rules may cause hardship or not fit every conceivable situation. The department therefore establishes these procedures and criteria to accommodate those situations where strict adherence would not be in the best interest of the public.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 200) #8461-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #10594, eff 7-1-14",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw200.html"
